  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1632/46/perkumpulan_senapan_daffa_20apng-png.png\" alt=\"alt text\"></p>\n<h1>Kofi 贊助：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdaffatheone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/daffatheone</a></h1>\n<h1>PayPal 贊助：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fDaffatheOne\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://paypal.me/DaffatheOne</a></h1>\n<p><strong>若您遇到 <span style=\"color:#ff0fbd\">紫色棋盤格</span> 錯誤……您可以從 JAR 檔案中提取「daffas」資料夾，並放置到「tacz」資料夾內。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>請務必安裝 TACZ 模組才能使用本擴充內容！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>建議將視野（FOV）設定為 90，以確保準星位置正確！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>這是一個模組……請將其安裝至 mods 資料夾。</strong></p>\n<h3>感謝贊助者：Sabastien、Antony、Monica</h3>\n<h1>介紹：Daffa 軍械庫</h1>\n<p>唯一一款能提供接近最新《決勝時刻》系列射擊手感與滿足感的 TACZ 擴充模組。</p>\n<p>沒錯。</p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KJVyPSFGFNA\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3NdvrUsqil4\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>武器列表</h1>\n<h3>HK-416</h3>\n<h3>還有更多武器</h3>\n<h1>配件列表</h1>\n<h3>還有更多配件</h3>\n<h1>製作人員</h1>\n<h3>DaffaTheOne（槍械包開發）</h3>\n<h3>Corrineduck（編譯）</h3>",
